{"sba-keyaki-16330":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんわん🐶⭐︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日も一日お疲れ様です😌💚\n \n \n \n 久々にねると2人ショット。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMA40CA1938YTT29N8YXWA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 髪切ったねるも可愛い♩\n 今日、たまたま長崎県産のトマトを食べたのですが美味しすぎてビックリ!しました。\n \n それをねるに話したら喜んでくれた✩\n 地元の産物を褒められるって嬉しいよね〜!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 7thシングルの個別握手会応募して下さった皆さん、ありがとうございます!🌟\n 7thこそは、24部全て完売目指していきたいです!!\n \n 今回は、9/15の幕張メッセ以外は2.3.4.5部なのでちょっとゆっくりめのスタートです😌💓\n 寝坊の心配はないよ〜〜笑😉\n \n 7th個握はなに着よう🤨!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 石森虹花🌈🌼\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMA4ZPSB2SN94QCKJS2SBQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ねるーねるらーねるれすと💓"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7523":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やぁみんな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ、最終オーディションの時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼくの顔を見たかね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰やこいつってツッコんだ自分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回転寿司に行った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行った時間が遅くて座った席が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょうどカーブのところで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寿司が回ってこなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員さんの案内が間違ってたみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきな炙りサーモンがなかった泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くぅっそー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで他の握手会って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行った事あるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全くないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の乃木メンのブログに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしたことある??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雷とか大丈夫なほう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ前雷なってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"となりにいた生駒がしがみついてきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいなぁって思ってた‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー私はそんな怖がらないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート(ワンピ以外で)より、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンツルックの方が多い印象が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるんだけど、実際は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちのほうが持ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートよりワンピ派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンツスタイルもすきだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニムがいっぱいあるかな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリ撮ったりするー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく取るプリ機とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなプリ機あるー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は撮らないなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機種は詳しくない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮るとしてもそんなに盛らない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナチュラルなのえらんでるかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼくのおねーちゃんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まり姉ですね←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頼れるねーちゃんになれるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぜ！！もりもり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元、原宿、渋谷、乃木坂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（←場所の名前ね）どこが1番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃ乃木坂でしょーよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ばんざい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古着だけじゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイブランドわかるのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこまで詳しくないかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳にピアスしよーと思うんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃそはピアスしてるのと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してないのどっちがいいと、思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、するなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何個ぐらいがいいと思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちでも良いと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偶数より奇数の方が良いって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いたことある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は開けないだろうな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤリングでがまん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギャグ漫画日和を見たことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔漫画読んだことある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今は内容覚えてない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"p